Origin
------

RTDesk Server is a modified version of CortenDesk 1.15.0
(https://github.com/marcpope/cortendesk), Copyright (C) Marc Pope and the
CortenDesk contributors, licensed AGPL-3.0-only. RIRAKTECH SARL modified it
from 28 October 2026 on: RTDesk name and logos, French texts in the web
client, self-enrollment of RTDesk installs, and device approval and
incoming-only endpoints in the automation API. The git history of this
repository lists every change and its date.

The bundled ID and relay servers (hbbs, hbbr) are CortenDesk Server
(https://github.com/marcpope/cortendesk-server), a fork of rustdesk-server,
licensed AGPL-3.0.

